        "official_en_sha256": "413b04a16cc782b3d942cf12a21a94cfb316144a6b9092cc3c94a596f48c83eb"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "じゃ、ディルマギアに戻りましょ。\r\n造船所に兄さんも呼んで、一緒に設計図を調べてみるわ。",
        "official_en": "Let’s get back to Dilmagia. I’ll have Evan meet us at the shipyard to check the blueprints.",
        "real_en": "Then let's head back to Dilmagia. I'll ask my older brother to meet us at the shipyard so we can look over the blueprints together."
      },
