        "official_en_sha256": "6386152e1ae02d67be8b51165eb7953598e556bf35812fffb8dd5d471d7c87ba"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そんなことがあったのか……。\r\nそれじゃ使いづらいな。",
        "official_en": "I had no idea. That changes things, doesn’t it?",
        "real_en": "So that happened... I can see why it'd be hard to use it."
