      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "テストに失敗したこともあるけど……。\r\n戦争に使えるかどうかが\r\n飛空艇の開発には重要になっていったから。",
        "official_en": "The failed test was just one reason for halting its development. The other reason was that potential military applications became a more important factor in developing airships.",
